    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In a first for the country, Kenya Simulation Network (KSN) was officially launched, marking a major milestone for healthcare education and practice in the country. This collaborative body unites hospitals and medical universities across Kenya, with a shared mission to advance healthcare delivery through simulation-based training and innovation.",
